    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42307" root="وكر" body-key="w">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَكَرَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَكِرُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَكْرٌ</span> (S, K) and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وُكُورٌ</span>, (K,) <i>He</i> (a bird) <i>came to the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَكْر</span> [or
<i>nest</i>]: (K:) or <i>entered his</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَكْر</span>. (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَكَرَ</span>,
(Mgh, Msb,) aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَكِرُ</span>, (Msb,) <i>He</i> (a bird) <i>took
for himself,</i> or <i>made,</i> or <i>prepared,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِتَّخذ</span>,) a
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَكْر</span>; (Mgh, Msb;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وكّر</span></b> , (A, Mgh,
Msb, TA,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوْكِيرٌ</span>; (TA;) but the latter
has an intensive signification; (Msb;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِتَّكَرَ</span></b> .
(K.) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْكَرَ</span> in this sense is a mistake. (Mgh.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَكَرَ</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَكِرُ</span>; (K;) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وكّر</span></b> , (A, L,
Msb,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوْكِيرٌ</span>; (Fr, S, L;) <i>He made,</i> or
<i>prepared, the food called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَكِيرَة</span>; (Fr, S, A, L,
Msb;) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَهُمْ</span> <i>for them.</i> (L, K.)

